1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:03,460
(Leonard:)Okay, we need to talk.

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:04,720
(Sheldon:)About what?

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,330
(Leonard:)Cats, Sheldon.

4
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,340
(Leonard:)You're clearly upset
about Amy being gone,

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,060
(Leonard:)and you're trying to replace
her with a bunch of cats.

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,640
Clowder. What?

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:16,010
(Sheldon:)A group of cats is a clowder.
Or a glaring.

8
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,060
(Leonard:)Okay, yeah, fine.

9
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,760
(Sheldon:)It's the kind of thing you ought

10
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,430
(Sheldon:)to know now that we have one.

11
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:23,690
Terrific. My point is,
you need to face up

12
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,650
(Leonard:)to what you're feeling
with this breakup.

13
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,910
(Sheldon:)It wasn't a breakup.

14
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,810
(Sheldon:)A breakup would imply that
Amy was my girlfriend.

15
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:31,330
Okay, I got it, I got it;
she's not your girlfriend.

16
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,690
(Leonard:)Now listen to me.

17
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,280
(Leonard:)I know about loneliness.

18
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,620
(Leonard:)I know about trying to replace
someone with other stuff.

19
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,500
(Leonard:)When I broke up with Penny,
I got back into my cello,

20
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,620
(Leonard:)I built a bunch of model rockets,

21
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:48,140
(Leonard:)I got those weightlifting gloves
and that five-pound dumbbell.

22
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:51,510
(Sheldon:)You didn't break up,
she dumped you.

23
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:53,460
(Leonard:)She didn't dump me.

24
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:54,850
(Leonard:)It was mutual!

25
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,520
(Sheldon:)I was there. She dumped you.

26
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,900
(Leonard:)Okay, fine.

27
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,190
(Leonard:)Live with cats.

